(6479, -1, 'setting_activememberdays_desc', 'vbsettings', 'Enter a number of days here that represents a threshold for \'active\' members. If a user has visited the board within the past number of days you specify, they are considered \'active\'.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnter \'0\' to treat all members as \'active\'.', 'vbulletin', '', 0, ''),
