(6943, -1, 'setting_quickedit_desc', 'vbsettings', 'By enabling Quick Edit, a click on the Edit button in a post will open an editor within that post via AJAX if the visitor\'s browser is compatible.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUsers may use the full editor by clicking the \'Go Advanced\' button in the inline editor.', 'vbulletin', '', 0, ''),
