(7099, -1, 'setting_stopshouting_desc', 'vbsettings', 'Prevent your users \'shouting\' in their thread titles/message text by changing all-uppercase titles with at least this many characters to capitalization only on the first letters of some words.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSet the value to 0 to disable this function.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDisable this for some international forums with different character sets, as this may cause problems.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 1199365466, '3.7.0 Beta 4'),
