(7113, -1, 'setting_tagcloud_levels_desc', 'vbsettings', 'The number of <em>levels</em> to be shown in the tag cloud.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBy default, there are 5 levels named level1 to level5, with the font size growing from its smallest size at level 1 to its largest at level 5.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIncreasing this value above 5 requires a template change.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 1206528487, '3.7.0 Release Candidate 2'),
