(7115, -1, 'setting_tagcloud_searchcloud_desc', 'vbsettings', 'This option controls whether a tag cloud relating to the frequency of tag searches is shown at the bottom of the advanced search.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA usage-based tag cloud is always shown <a href=\"../tags.php\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 1206527947, '3.7.0 Release Candidate 2'),
