(7125, -1, 'setting_tagdelimiter_desc', 'vbsettings', 'This option allows you to specify additional tag separators. Regardless of the value here, a comma will always be used as a separator.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSeparate each tag separators with a space. If you would like to use a space in a tag separator, click the \'?\' for information on the advanced separator syntax. ', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 1218107556, '3.8.0 Alpha 1'),
