(7175, -1, 'setting_tmppath_desc', 'vbsettings', 'If your server is running in PHP Safe Mode, you\'ll need to specify a directory that is CHMOD to 777 that will act as a temporary directory for uploads. You may also need to set this if you have open_basedir restrictions in place. All files are removed from this directory after database insertion.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b>Note:</b> Do NOT include the trailing slash (\'/\') after the directory name.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 1311634639, '3.8.11 Release Candidate 2'),
