(8777, -1, 'options_options_pc_enabled_text', 'cphelptext', 'Picture comments are a messaging system associated with user-uploaded pictures in albums, which allow other users to comment on these pictures.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you would like to enable this system, set this option to \'Yes\'.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 1205419881, '3.7.0 Release Candidate 1'),
