(8779, -1, 'options_options_pc_maxperpage_text', 'cphelptext', 'In conjunction with the \'Default Picture Comments Per-Page\' option, this setting allows you to limit the number of picture comments that can be shown on a single page when visitors manually change the per-page option.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b>Note: </b>This number must be at least 1.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 1208955559, '3.7.0 Release Candidate 4'),
