(10063, -1, 'thread_unsubscribe_ids_text', 'cphelptext', 'All users who are subscribed to these threads will be unsubscribed from them.  You can get a thread\'s threadid by looking at its URL.  For example, a thread with this URL - http://www.domain.com/forum/showthread.php?t=5323 - has a threadid of 5323.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 0, ''),
