(10071, -1, 'thread_votes_text', 'cphelptext', 'This page allows you to see what users voted for what options for any poll on your forums.  Select a poll from the menu below and click the \"Who Voted\" button to see who voted for what.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 0, ''),
