(10073, -1, 'thread_votes_pollid_text', 'cphelptext', 'Select a poll from this menu.  The polls are ordered by pollid and so they are ordered by when they were posted.  Older polls will have a smaller pollid whereas newer polls will have a larger pollid.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 0, ''),
