(10191, -1, 'user_changehistory_text', 'cphelptext', 'This page shows the historical values of several pieces of user data, including:\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>User names</li>\r\n<li>Emails</li>\r\n<li>User group membership</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nThe user that made the change is also listed.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 1191257642, '3.7.0 Beta 1'),
