(10429, -1, 'usergroup_add_edit_canseeprofilepic_text', 'cphelptext', 'A user\'s profile picture is displayed on their profile page.  Profile pictures are a way for your users to upload pictures of themselves so everyone else can see what they look like.  This setting determines whether or not members of this usergroup can view those profile pictures.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 0, ''),
