(10469, -1, 'usergroup_add_edit_commentfollowforummoderation_text', 'cphelptext', 'If you disable this option then all picture comment made by members of this group will go into the <a href=\"../moderation.php?do=viewpcs&amp;type=moderated\" target=\"_blank\">moderation queue</a>.  You will need to validate their comments before they show up.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 1208787108, '3.7.0 Release Candidate 4'),
