(10669, -1, 'usergroup_edit_add_canalwayspostmessage_text', 'cphelptext', 'If this is set to \'yes\' the user will always be able to post messages in social groups, even when:\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The social group is configured with \'Users must join to view the content\'.</li>\r\n<li>The user is not a member of the group.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nNote: If the user has this permission, they will always be able to see the contents of groups configured with \'Invite Only\' and \'Users must join to view the content\'.', 'vbulletin', 'vBulletin Solutions', 1225812938, '3.8.0 Beta 2'),
